NymSharedTest
├── isAllowedNymUrl
│   ├── when the url is not parseable
│   │   └── it is rejected
│   ├── when the url is parseable
│   │   ├── given the protocol is not https
│   │   │   └── it is rejected
│   │   └── given the protocol is https
│   │       ├── given the host is not on the allowlist
│   │       │   └── it is rejected
│   │       └── given the host is on the allowlist
│   │           └── it is allowed
│   └── when the url is crafted to look allowed
│       ├── given credentials embed an allowed host
│       │   └── it is rejected
│       ├── given an allowed host is a subdomain of another
│       │   └── it is rejected
│       ├── given the host differs only by case
│       │   └── it is allowed
│       └── given the host has a trailing dot
│           └── it is rejected
└── clearNymDatabases
    ├── given indexedDB is unavailable
    │   └── it does nothing
    ├── given enumerating databases throws
    │   └── it swallows the error
    └── given databases exist
        ├── it deletes those belonging to nym
        └── it leaves unrelated databases alone
